He, the dad, got the report card and he said, all right, let's have a look.

149
00:07:25,940 --> 00:07:31,680
All right, this is a very common way to say, let's see, or let me look at that.

150
00:07:32,260 --> 00:07:33,560
So let's have a look.

151
00:07:33,740 --> 00:07:38,330
Maybe it's just one person, me, but we still say this, let, let us.

152
00:07:38,850 --> 00:07:39,490
So it's plural.

153
00:07:39,790 --> 00:07:42,930
It's very weird, but it just means let me look, let me see.

154
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:44,680
And exactly.

155
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:52,450
As you said, even though it's in plural and you may be by yourself or only you are going to look at something, people still say, let's have a look.

156
00:07:52,840 --> 00:07:53,430
Let's have a look here.

157
00:07:53,840 --> 00:07:58,760
It means I want to look at this, so if I say, Hey, I just bought this new CD.

158
00:07:58,760 --> 00:07:59,760
Okay.

